WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.760
We don't have a lot of facts.

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:09.000
Remember, these are the same folks who killed a person, an unarmed person, just a couple

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.300
of weeks ago in Franklin Park.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:15.400
